# Normalise to LF in the repository and in every checkout, including on Windows.
# The CLI entry points start with "#!/usr/bin/env node"; a CRLF line ending there breaks
# the published `amoxi` and `create-amoxi-app` commands on macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
